<title>USA: Cooper Industries Inc Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Cooper Industries Inc Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.81		    $0.68</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.76		     0.65</p>
<p> Net			 87,700		   73,200</p>
<p> Revs		   1,338,300		1,277,700</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     107,800		  107,600</p>
