<p> Avg shrs diluted     124,500		  128,700</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year 1995 net includes $186.6 million loss from discontinued opers. Shr from continuing opers is $2.51 primary and $2.41 fully diluted.</p>
<p>Net includes securities sales gains of $0.04/shr vs $0.01 for Q4 and $0.05/shr vs $0.05 for year.</p>
